 alt attribute. Screen-readers already announce `img` tags as an image. You don’t need to use the words `image`, `photo,` or `picture` (or any specified custom words) in the alt prop.","'onLogout' is assigned a value but never used.","'useSelector' is defined but never used.","'useNavigate' is defined but never used.","'imglogo' is defined but never used.","'imguser' is defined but never used.","no-dupe-keys","Duplicate key 'serverUrl'.","ObjectExpression"]